	(text "USB3320C-EZK-TR, ULPI OUTPUT CLOCK mode: the PHY generates the 60 MHz\nULPI clock on CLKOUT -> STM32 ULPI_CK (PA5). REFCLK takes the shared\n24 MHz reference; REFSEL[2:0]=111 (DS Table 5-10). RBIAS 8.06k 1% and\nRVBUS 10k (device-only) are datasheet-mandated values (DS 2.1, Table 5-7).\nID tied to VDD33 = device-only operation (DS 5.6.1). CPEN / SPK_L / SPK_R /\nXO / N-C are unused: no OTG VBUS switch, no audio, no crystal.\nRESETB has no internal pull-down - the 10k holds the PHY in reset while the\nSTM32 pins are hi-Z, which also covers the VDD18-before-VDDIO sequence note.\nNO TEST POINTS ON THE ULPI BUS - DEC-0018 ruling 1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 204.47 92.71 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "482d4309-721b-5ff9-a112-6ea5867396ac")
	)
