	(text "SPARE MCU I/O BREAKOUT (DNP)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 134.62 200.66 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "29b3e244-5015-5c79-b991-6bbd2ddfefe7")
	)
	(text "Ten MCU pins are unallocated in the .ioc. Seven of them are brought\nout here so a wire mod can serve OQ-06 (EEPROM nWP) and OQ-07 (rail\nPGOOD / enable) without a board spin. DNP by default - fit only if\nneeded. PC14/PC15 (OSC32) and PH1-OSC_OUT are left unconnected so a\n32.768 kHz LSE remains possible on a later revision."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 135.89 232.41 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "f29dd1ed-cafc-51da-8aee-607cfd2700c8")
	)
	(text "STM32H723VET6 + USB3320 ULPI PHY + USB-C (data only) + OCTOSPI1 PSRAM\nPin map authority: hardware/cubemx/ARIA_SRB_FAFF_2_POC_CBs_1.ioc (DEC-0013) - nothing here re-pins it.\nLocal labels stay on this sheet: ULPI_*, QSPI_P1_*, USB_*, HSE_CLK_24M, USB3320_nRESET, SPARE_*, +3V3_USB, +1V8_USB.\nHierarchical labels leave it; the full list, and the naming choices behind it, are in docs/decisions/actuator-sch-mcu.md.\nPC2_C / PC3_C carry ULPI_DIR and ULPI_NXT: firmware MUST close the SYSCFG_PMCR analog switch (PC2SO/PC3SO)\nbefore the ULPI link will run - the pins are otherwise isolated from the digital I/O. DS13313 6.3.16 Table 56."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 224.79 205.74 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "c180b6c8-22db-5e87-a94d-fff74ce0ec3f")
	)
	(text "TEST ACCESS (TEST_PLAN 4).  TPs: NRST (hook), BOOT0, HSE clock (dual TP at the\noscillator, block B), +3V3_USB and +1V8_USB (block E). MCO2 leaves the sheet as\nADS1235_CLKIN and is probed in loadcell_afe, which owns that net's break.\nSupply-pin groups are reachable at the decoupling banks in blocks A, D, E and F.\nDELIBERATELY NO test points on ULPI or OCTOSPI (DEC-0018 ruling 1 / TEST_PLAN 2.2).\n\nROOT SHEET NEEDS.  Every hierarchical label on this sheet is a sheet pin on the\nmcu block of the root sheet, drawn and wired by the integration pass that closed\nDEC-0009; project ERC is clean at severity-all with none of them suppressed. The\nlist and the direction of every net is in docs/decisions/actuator-sch-mcu.md,\nand the root-sheet geometry in docs/decisions/actuator-sch-integrate.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 224.79 220.98 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "b940b122-2175-5be6-af8d-a093faa1f973")
	)
